  "notes": "A completed card under an open fan-out posts nothing of its own; its row carries the result. Failures, questions and a PR the card opened still post: the cited test also asserts the PR-opened notice, which is the pr-opened case and not encoded here. The summary is the completed event payload, as the pipeline carries it, where the test passes the text as the message.",
